1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,272
First sign-in: set up your authenticator.

2
00:00:03,272 --> 00:00:07,765
Sign in for the first time, add
MERIT to an authenticator app,

3
00:00:07,765 --> 00:00:10,267
and save your recovery codes.

4
00:00:11,861 --> 00:00:14,813
Use the MERIT address
provided by your agency.

5
00:00:14,813 --> 00:00:18,920
Your administrator supplies your
user name and initial password;

6
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:21,886
there is no public account registration.

7
00:00:22,247 --> 00:00:25,974
Enter your user name and
password, then choose Continue.

8
00:00:25,974 --> 00:00:30,833
Passwords and all security codes
are hidden in this training video.

9
00:00:31,188 --> 00:00:33,720
Every account needs a second factor.

10
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:38,643
In Microsoft Authenticator, add an
Other account and scan the QR code.

11
00:00:38,643 --> 00:00:42,067
Another authenticator
app can also scan it.

12
00:00:42,423 --> 00:00:43,423
Cannot scan?

13
00:00:43,423 --> 00:00:48,430
Choose Other account and enter the
account name and setup key manually.

14
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:50,334
Choose Time based if asked.

15
00:00:50,334 --> 00:00:52,546
Keep the setup key private.

16
00:00:52,846 --> 00:00:56,785
Use the current verification code
from the MERIT entry in your app.

17
00:00:56,785 --> 00:00:59,772
The setup key is not
the code to enter here.

18
00:01:00,127 --> 00:01:05,805
If a code fails, wait for a new one and
check automatic date and time on your

19
00:01:05,805 --> 00:01:06,805
phone.

20
00:01:06,805 --> 00:01:11,728
Keep this page open; starting sign-in
again creates a new setup key.

21
00:01:12,028 --> 00:01:15,987
Enter the current code and
choose Turn on and sign in.

22
00:01:16,353 --> 00:01:20,298
Each recovery code works once
if you lose your authenticator.

23
00:01:20,298 --> 00:01:25,484
Save them securely now; MERIT will not
show them again after you continue.

24
00:01:25,839 --> 00:01:28,517
Copy codes and Print codes are available.

25
00:01:28,517 --> 00:01:33,286
Store your own codes using your
agency-approved method; do not share them

26
00:01:33,286 --> 00:01:35,841
or put them in a support message.

27
00:01:36,197 --> 00:01:41,449
Continue to MERIT stays disabled until
you confirm that the codes are saved.

28
00:01:41,449 --> 00:01:45,166
Leaving this page does
not skip the requirement.

29
00:01:45,518 --> 00:01:51,351
After saving your codes, select I have
saved these codes, then Continue to MERIT.

30
00:01:51,351 --> 00:01:54,847
Your account is ready
for everyday sign-in.

31
00:01:56,011 --> 00:02:00,748
In this video you entered an
agency-provided account, added MERIT to an

32
00:02:00,748 --> 00:02:05,752
authenticator app, and saved and
acknowledged one-use recovery codes.
